# Dances with Luopans (adoulin 118), the homeland soil of Windurst: a level 99 Warrior of Windurst (nation 2), the
# quest accepted (a GM), no soil, no Luopan. The Ergon Locus of La Theine (San d'Oria's) and Konschtat (Bastok's):
# nothing; Tahrongi's (Windurst's): the Fistful of Homeland Soil (Tahrongi's KEYITEM_OBTAINED), no event.
lists TahrongiCanyon/Ergon_Locus/onTrigger LaTheinePlateau/Ergon_Locus/onTrigger
lists KonschtatHighlands/Ergon_Locus/onTrigger
char zone=TahrongiCanyon pos=92.346,40.444,339.803 job=WAR lvl=99 nation=2
